      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SET ALIGHT (4) scored well last start as odds-on favourite by half a length at this track in a handy 30.68 beating Ayla Zorro. Awkwardly drawn but in form and has the ability. Form reads well for this. VISTA YANK (5) shapes well for this on her exceptional win a few runs back, getting around Hobart over 461m in 25.88 then hitting the frame in both runs since. Top win three back and rates a key player again. BUCKLE UP MENZIE (7) stalked the lead from a middle draw and boxed on well to finish 2.25 lengths back in second (29.74) at this track in a Grade 4 over 515m. Expected to feature again. CANYA LEXI (1) has strong credentials from this draw.",
